//! The `interest-delay-end` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property
//! specifies the delay between the user losing interest in an [interest
//! invoker](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Popover_API/Using_interest_invokers)
//! element and the `loseinterest` event firing.
//!
//! Initial: normal. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - normal: Sets the delay to the browser's default delay. This is the initial value.
//!
//! Grammar: normal | <time>
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui-4/#propdef-interest-delay-end
//!
//! Author guide:
